We train \themethod{} to predict the outcome of a perturbation experiment based on the symbolic representation of the perturbation, readout, and context (the P,R,C tuple).
\themethod{} features a PRC-conditioned architecture (method details in \Cref{sec:methods}) which enables learning from heterogeneous perturbation experiments that do not necessarily fully overlap in the perturbation, readout, or context dimensions.
